// A program prints a carriage return (byte 13). The bootstrap wrapper must
// pass it on: stdout is the bytes a, CR, b, newline. A CHECK line cannot hold
// a CR byte, and the text mode of tools/diff_runtimes.py turns each CR into a
// newline, so this probe has no STATUS line and tools/check_cr_bytes.py
// compares its raw stdout bytes with native.
print "a" + chr(13) + "b";
